@host = http://localhost:5065

### 0. Health & Welcome Check (Verify API is Running)
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### 1. Module 1: Admin Login (Generates JWT Token)
# Run this first! Copy the "accessToken" from the response into the @token variable below.
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "admin",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Store the token from login response
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2. Module 1: Get Current User Profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Module 1: Get All Configured Roles & Permissions
GET {{host}}/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Module 2: List Schools (Includes Rural / Marginalized status)
# @name getSchools
GET {{host}}/api/v1/schools
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Module 2: List All Registered Students (Includes BPL & Socioeconomic Factors)
# @name getStudents
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Module 2: Get Vulnerable Student Profile (Sunita Kumari - ADM-2025-002)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/admission/ADM-2025-002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Module 3: Get Attendance Roster for Grade 9-A
# Uses Section ID from the seeded student
GET {{host}}/api/v1/attendance/roster?sectionId={{getStudents.response.body.data.items[0].currentSectionId}}&date=2025-04-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Module 3: Get Chronic Absenteeism Alerts (< 85% Attendance)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/attendance/alerts/chronic-absentees?schoolId={{getSchools.response.body.data.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Module 4: Get Subjects Configured for School
GET {{host}}/api/academics/subjects/school/{{getSchools.response.body.data.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Module 4: Get Scheduled Assessments (Midterms & Quarterlies)
# @name getAssessments
GET {{host}}/api/academics/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Module 4: Get Grading Roster for Mathematics Midterm
GET {{host}}/api/academics/assessments/{{getAssessments.response.body.data[0].id}}/roster
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Module 4: Get Student Report Card with GPA & Core Subject Failures
# Sunita Kumari (Student 2 - Failed Math and Science)
GET {{host}}/api/academics/analytics/report-card/{{getStudents.response.body.data.items[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Module 4: Get Academic Trajectory (Triggers Academic Shock Alert: 40% -> 20%)
GET {{host}}/api/academics/analytics/trajectory/{{getStudents.response.body.data.items[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Module 4: Get At-Risk Academic Students in School (Core Subject Failure)
GET {{host}}/api/academics/analytics/at-risk/school/{{getSchools.response.body.data.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
